//github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/b957dcc) 2026-10-24 feat: make Cube the default theme across the library\n- [`3b7e8f6`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/3b7e8f6) 2026-10-24 test: complete Mobile Pro simulator regression evidence\n- [`6328a21`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/6328a21) 2026-10-24 feat: integrate Native Pro components with four-theme preview\n- [`6a1568b`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/6a1568b) 2026-10-24 refactor: label Cube mobile previews consistently\n- [`4f59682`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/4f59682) 2026-10-24 test: verify Native gestures in light and dark themes\n- [`6630c4e`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/6630c4e) 2026-10-24 fix: validate Native themes and repair preview interactions\n- [`886b436`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/886b436) 2026-10-24 feat: complete Native catalog and unify Cube previews\n- [`aeef4ed`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/aeef4ed) 2026-10-24 Link Cube guides and align docs with merged Native work\n- [`71edeb9`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/71edeb9) 2026-10-24 docs: align design-system guides with Native implementation\n- [`87fef4b`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/87fef4b) 2026-10-24 feat: add Cube Native theme and Expo component previews\n- [`81b35f1`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/81b35f1) 2026-10-24 Integrate Cube design guides and agent discovery rules\n- [`9c48eed`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/9c48eed) 2026-10-23 Add live Cube preview workflow and component docs\n- [`6bd8374`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/6bd8374) 2026-10-23 Restore Cube component gallery and application templates\n- [`97393c2`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/97393c2) 2026-10-23 Document Cube UI usage and future AI tooling\n- [`e8363d8`](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system/commit/e8363d8) 2026-10-23 Initialize private Cube UI component library",preview:null,boards:[]},{slug:`contribute`,title:`贡献`,description:`改文档、组件和主题时的短路径。仓库是私有的。`,section:`contribute`,markdown:"仓库是私有的：[cube-design-system](https://github.com/yuchuanux-a11y/cube-design-system)。没有访问权限就打不开源文件。这份页面不授予发布权限。\n\n改之前先查现有实现：\n\n- Web 组件：`python3 scripts/cube_catalog.py list`（仓库内，只读）\n- 设计资料：`python3 docs/design-system/scripts/ds.py search <关键词>`\n\n两条状态不要合成一个：规范可以是 draft，同时代码已经能导入。只有规范、实现和发布证据都齐，才把它写成已验收。\n\n小改动留在使用处。新的公共组件、token 或模式先查重，再改 `cube-contract.css` 或对应组件，并更新会受影响的文档。主题不要另写一套别名。Figma 节点只改 `apps/docs/data/figma-pages.json`。\n\n文档站的检查：\n\n```sh\nyarn docs:build\n```\n\n设计索引和组件索引还有单独的校验脚本，见仓库 `AGENTS.md`。本页不代替那些检查。\n\n更完整的草案在私有仓库 `docs/design-system/governance.md`。那里的流程是建议，不自动变成发布能力。\n\n## 本地模板\n\n这五个 Next 应用没有发布到公开画廊。端口来自 `docs/PREVIEW.md`。\n\n| 模板 | 包 | 端口 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Chat | `@bosagent/cube-template-chat` | 3004 |\n| CRM | `@bosagent/cube-template-crm` | 3007 |\n| Dashboard | `@bosagent/cube-template-dashboard` | 3003 |\n| Email | `@bosagent/cube-template-email` | 3005 |\n| Finances | `@bosagent/cube-template-finances` | 3006 |\n\n```sh\nyarn workspace @bosagent/cube-template-chat dev\n```",preview:null,boards:[]},{slug:`cube/agent-question`,title:`AgentQuestion`,description:"Cube component `AgentQuestion` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/agent-question`.",section:`cube`,markdown:'# AgentQuestion\n\nCube component `AgentQuestion` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/agent-question`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/agent-question`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { AgentQuestion } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/agent-question";\nimport { AgentQuestion } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n## Parts\n\n- `AgentQuestion.Actions`\n- `AgentQuestion.Choice`\n- `AgentQuestion.Choices`\n- `AgentQuestion.Field`\n- `AgentQuestion.Kicker`\n- `AgentQuestion.Note`\n- `AgentQuestion.Option`\n- `AgentQuestion.Options`\n- `AgentQuestion.Title`\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#AgentQuestion)',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`AgentQuestion`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/approval-card`,title:`ApprovalCard`,description:"Cube component `ApprovalCard` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/approval-card`.",section:`cube`,markdown:'# ApprovalCard\n\nCube component `ApprovalCard` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/approval-card`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/approval-card`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { ApprovalCard } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/approval-card";\nimport { ApprovalCard } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `question` | `string` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `confirmation` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `confirmLabel` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `context` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `customLabel` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `customPlaceholder` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `customValue` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `error` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `mode` | `ApprovalMode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `options` | `readonly ApprovalOption[]` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `showCustom` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `state` | `ApprovalStatus` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `step` | `ApprovalStep` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `summary` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `value` | `string \\| readonly string[]` | 否 | `—` | Selected option id, or ids when `mode` is `multiple`. |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n<details className="not-prose my-6">\n<summary className="cursor-pointer text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground">无障碍与事件</summary>\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `onConfirm` | `() => void` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `onCustomValueChange` | `(value: string) => void` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `onDismiss` | `() => void` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `onRetry` | `() => void` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `onReview` | `() => void` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `onStepChange` | `(index: number) => void` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `onValueChange` | `(value: string \\| readonly string[]) => void` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n</details>\n\n## Figma\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/D5ZApigd5hFmvI54TkJlAh/Cube-Design-System-for-Web?node-id=24028-3587\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#ApprovalCard)',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`ApprovalCard`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/approval-result`,title:`ApprovalResult`,description:"Cube component `ApprovalResult` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/approval-result`.",section:`cube`,markdown:'# ApprovalResult\n\nCube component `ApprovalResult` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/approval-result`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/approval-result`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { ApprovalResult } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/approval-result";\nimport { ApprovalResult } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `defaultExpanded` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `expanded` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n<details className="not-prose my-6">\n<summary className="cursor-pointer text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground">无障碍与事件</summary>\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `onExpandedChange` | `(expanded: boolean) => void` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n</details>\n\n## Parts\n\n- `ApprovalResult.Detail`\n- `ApprovalResult.Icon`\n- `ApprovalResult.Label`\n- `ApprovalResult.Trigger`\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#ApprovalResult)',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`ApprovalResult`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/chain-of-thought`,title:`ChainOfThought`,description:`isStreaming 由宿主提供，控制点阵与文字效果；展开箭头保留 Enter/Space 操作。`,section:`cube`,markdown:'# ChainOfThought\n\nCube component `ChainOfThought` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chain-of-thought`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/chain-of-thought`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { ChainOfThought } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/chain-of-thought";\nimport { ChainOfThought } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | The children of the component. A function may be provided to alter the children based on component state. |\n| `isStreaming` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Show shimmer styling on the trigger while reasoning is in progress. |\n| `className` | `ClassNameOrFunction<DisclosureRenderProps>` | 否 | `\'react-aria-Disclosure\'` | The CSS [className](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/className) for the element. A function may be provided to compute the class based on component state. |\n| `defaultExpanded` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Whether the disclosure is expanded by default (uncontrolled). |\n| `id` | `Key` | 否 | `—` | An id for the disclosure when used within a DisclosureGroup, matching the id used in `expandedKeys`. |\n| `isDisabled` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Whether the disclosure is disabled. |\n| `isExpanded` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Whether the disclosure is expanded (controlled). |\n| `render` | `DOMRenderFunction<"div", DisclosureRenderProps>` | 否 | `—` | Overrides the default DOM element with a custom render function. This allows rendering existing components with built-in styles and behaviors such as router links, animation libraries, and pre-styled components. Requirements: - You must render the expected element type (e.g. if `<button>` is expected, you cannot render an `<a>`). - Only a single root DOM element can be rendered (no fragments). - You must pass through props and ref to the underlying DOM element, merging with your own prop as appropriate. |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | A slot name for the component. Slots allow the component to receive props from a parent component. An explicit `null` value indicates that the local props completely override all props received from a parent. |\n| `style` | `StyleOrFunction<DisclosureRenderProps>` | 否 | `—` | The inline [style](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/style) for the element. A function may be provided to compute the style based on component state. |\n\n<details className="not-prose my-6">\n<summary className="cursor-pointer text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground">无障碍与事件</summary>\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `onExpandedChange` | `(isExpanded: boolean) => void` | 否 | `—` | Handler that is called when the disclosure\'s expanded state changes. |\n\n</details>\n\n## Parts\n\n- `ChainOfThought.Content`\n- `ChainOfThought.Step`\n- `ChainOfThought.Steps`\n- `ChainOfThought.Trigger`\n\n## Token\n\n[`--default`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--focus`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--font-sans`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--font-weight-normal`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--foreground`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--muted`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--spacing`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-body`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-body--line-height`](#Docs/foundations/color)\n\n## Figma\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/D5ZApigd5hFmvI54TkJlAh/Cube-Design-System-for-Web?node-id=23491-73610\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#ChainOfThought)\n\n## 适用\n\n- isStreaming 由宿主提供，控制点阵与文字效果；展开箭头保留 Enter/Space 操作。\n\n## 不适用\n\n- 本批仅同步过程行交互反馈，完整步骤布局未迁移。\n- 不要把本地步骤或计时样例作为真实推理、任务执行或授权的证明。',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`ChainOfThought`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/chat-attachment`,title:`ChatAttachment`,description:"Cube component `ChatAttachment` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-attachment`.",section:`cube`,markdown:'# ChatAttachment\n\nCube component `ChatAttachment` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-attachment`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-attachment`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { ChatAttachment } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-attachment";\nimport { ChatAttachment } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `React.ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `mediaType` | `ChatAttachmentMediaType` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `mimeType` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `name` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `size` | `number` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `src` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `variant` | `ChatAttachmentVariant` | 否 | `—` | Use media for the Figma 64px tile, including files without a preview. Omit for automatic file/media layout. |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n## Parts\n\n- `ChatAttachment.Icon`\n- `ChatAttachment.Info`\n- `ChatAttachment.Name`\n- `ChatAttachment.Preview`\n- `ChatAttachment.Remove`\n- `ChatAttachment.Size`\n\n## Figma\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/D5ZApigd5hFmvI54TkJlAh/Cube-Design-System-for-Web?node-id=23482-1151\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#ChatAttachment)',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`ChatAttachment`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/chat-conversation`,title:`ChatConversation`,description:`以 Content 组合消息，ScrollButton 让用户返回最新消息。向上阅读时停止自动跟随，回到末尾恢复。`,section:`cube`,markdown:'# ChatConversation\n\nCube component `ChatConversation` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-conversation`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-conversation`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { ChatConversation } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-conversation";\nimport { ChatConversation } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `initial` | `"smooth" \\| "instant"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `resize` | `"smooth" \\| "instant"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n## Parts\n\n- `ChatConversation.Content`\n- `ChatConversation.ScrollAnchor`\n- `ChatConversation.ScrollButton`\n\n## Token\n\n[`--background`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--border`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--focus-outer`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--foreground`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--radius-2xl`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--spacing`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--surface`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--surface-shadow`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-body`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-body--line-height`](#Docs/foundations/color)\n\n## Figma\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/D5ZApigd5hFmvI54TkJlAh/Cube-Design-System-for-Web?node-id=23497-73789\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#ChatConversation)\n\n## 适用\n\n- 以 Content 组合消息，ScrollButton 让用户返回最新消息。向上阅读时停止自动跟随，回到末尾恢复。\n- 默认 role=log、名称 Conversation，可由宿主提供本地化 aria-label。\n\n## 不适用\n\n- 不要用自动滚动证明 agent 已输出或任务完成。\n- 本批核对容器与滚动；嵌套完整会话中的其余组件不自动获得设计验收。',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`ChatConversation`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/chat-list-view`,title:`ChatListView`,description:"Cube component `ChatListView` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-list-view`.",section:`cube`,markdown:'# ChatListView\n\nCube component `ChatListView` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-list-view`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-list-view`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { ChatListView } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-list-view";\nimport { ChatListView } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `density` | `"compact" \\| "comfortable"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `renderEmptyState` | `() => ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | Render function for the empty state. |\n| `rowGap` | `number` | 否 | `0` | Gap between virtualized rows in pixels. Static rows use CSS. |\n| `rowHeight` | `number` | 否 | `48` | Estimated row height in pixels for virtualization. |\n| `virtualized` | `boolean` | 否 | `false` | Enable row virtualization for large datasets. |\n| `autoFocus` | `boolean \\| FocusStrategy` | 否 | `—` | Whether to auto focus the gridlist or an option. |\n| `children` | `React.ReactNode \\| ((item: T) => ReactNode)` | 否 | `—` | The contents of the collection. |\n| `className` | `ClassNameOrFunction<GridListRenderProps>` | 否 | `\'react-aria-GridList\'` | The CSS [className](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/className) for the element. A function may be provided to compute the class based on component state. |\n| `defaultSelectedKeys` | `"all" \\| Iterable<Key>` | 否 | `—` | The initial selected keys in the collection (uncontrolled). |\n| `dependencies` | `readonly any[]` | 否 | `—` | Values that should invalidate the item cache when using dynamic collections. |\n| `disabledBehavior` | `DisabledBehavior` | 否 | `\'all\'` | Whether `disabledKeys` applies to all interactions, or only selection. |\n| `disabledKeys` | `Iterable<Key>` | 否 | `—` | The item keys that are disabled. These items cannot be selected, focused, or otherwise interacted with. |\n| `disallowEmptySelection` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Whether the collection allows empty selection. |\n| `disallowTypeAhead` | `boolean` | 否 | `false` | Whether typeahead navigation is disabled. |\n| `dragAndDropHooks` | `DragAndDropHooks<NoInfer<T>>` | 否 | `—` | The drag and drop hooks returned by `useDragAndDrop` used to enable drag and drop behavior for the GridList. |\n| `escapeKeyBehavior` | `"none" \\| "clearSelection"` | 否 | `\'clearSelection\'` | Whether pressing the escape key should clear selection in the grid list or not. Most experiences should not modify this option as it eliminates a keyboard user\'s ability to easily clear selection. Only use if the escape key is being handled externally or should not trigger selection clearing contextually. |\n| `items` | `Iterable<T>` | 否 | `—` | Item objects in the collection. |\n| `keyboardNavigationBehavior` | `"tab" \\| "arrow"` | 否 | `\'arrow\'` | Whether keyboard navigation to focusable elements within grid list items is via the left/right arrow keys or the tab key. |\n| `render` | `DOMRenderFunction<"div", GridListRenderProps>` | 否 | `—` | Overrides the default DOM element with a custom render function. This allows rendering existing components with built-in styles and behaviors such as router links, animation libraries, and pre-styled components. Requirements: - You must render the expected element type (e.g. if `<button>` is expected, you cannot render an `<a>`). - Only a single root DOM element can be rendered (no fragments). - You must pass through props and ref to the underlying DOM element, merging with your own prop as appropriate. |\n| `selectedKeys` | `"all" \\| Iterable<Key>` | 否 | `—` | The currently selected keys in the collection (controlled). |\n| `selectionBehavior` | `SelectionBehavior` | 否 | `\'toggle\'` | How multiple selection should behave in the collection. |\n| `selectionMode` | `SelectionMode` | 否 | `—` | The type of selection that is allowed in the collection. |\n| `shouldSelectOnPressUp` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Whether selection should occur on press up instead of press down. |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | A slot name for the component. Slots allow the component to receive props from a parent component. An explicit `null` value indicates that the local props completely override all props received from a parent. |\n| `style` | `StyleOrFunction<GridListRenderProps>` | 否 | `—` | The inline [style](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/style) for the element. A function may be provided to compute the style based on component state. |\n| `UNSTABLE_focusOnEntry` | `"first" \\| "last"` | 否 | `—` | Which item in the collection to focus when tabbing into the collection. Overrides default roving tab index like behavior. |\n\n<details className="not-prose my-6">\n<summary className="cursor-pointer text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground">无障碍与事件</summary>\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `onAction` | `(key: Key) => void` | 否 | `—` | Handler that is called when a user performs an action on an item. The exact user event depends on the collection\'s `selectionBehavior` prop and the interaction modality. |\n| `onSelectionChange` | `(keys: Selection) => void` | 否 | `—` | Handler that is called when the selection changes. |\n\n</details>\n\n## Parts\n\n- `ChatListView.Icon`\n- `ChatListView.Item`\n- `ChatListView.ItemContent`\n- `ChatListView.Meta`\n- `ChatListView.Preview`\n- `ChatListView.Text`\n- `ChatListView.Title`\n\n## Figma\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/D5ZApigd5hFmvI54TkJlAh/Cube-Design-System-for-Web?node-id=23493-73737\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#ChatListView)',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`ChatListView`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/chat-loader`,title:`ChatLoader`,description:`Indicator 提供 Drive / Orbit / Static 三种点阵与12/15/18px尺寸。旧 Dots/Pulse 对应 Drive，Spinner 对应 Orbit。`,section:`cube`,markdown:'# ChatLoader\n\nCube component `ChatLoader` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-loader`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-loader`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { ChatLoader } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-loader";\nimport { ChatLoader } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n\n### Dots\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `label` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `size` | `"md" \\| "lg" \\| "sm"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### Drive\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `label` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `size` | `"md" \\| "lg" \\| "sm"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### Indicator\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `label` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `size` | `"md" \\| "lg" \\| "sm"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `type` | `ChatLoaderIndicatorType` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### Orbit\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `label` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `size` | `"md" \\| "lg" \\| "sm"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### Pulse\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `label` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `size` | `"md" \\| "lg" \\| "sm"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### Skeleton\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `label` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `showAvatar` | `boolean` | 否 | `true` | Default composition only; custom children take precedence. |\n| `showBlock` | `boolean` | 否 | `true` | Include the 64px content placeholder in the default composition. |\n| `size` | `"md" \\| "lg" \\| "sm"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### SkeletonAvatar\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### SkeletonBlock\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### SkeletonLine\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### SkeletonPanel\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### Spinner\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `label` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `size` | `"md" \\| "lg" \\| "sm"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### Static\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `label` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `size` | `"md" \\| "lg" \\| "sm"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n## Parts\n\n- `ChatLoader.Dots`\n- `ChatLoader.Drive`\n- `ChatLoader.Indicator`\n- `ChatLoader.Orbit`\n- `ChatLoader.Pulse`\n- `ChatLoader.Skeleton`\n- `ChatLoader.SkeletonAvatar`\n- `ChatLoader.SkeletonBlock`\n- `ChatLoader.SkeletonLine`\n- `ChatLoader.SkeletonPanel`\n- `ChatLoader.Spinner`\n- `ChatLoader.Static`\n\n## Token\n\n[`--surface`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--surface-tertiary`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--spacing`](#Docs/foundations/color)\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#ChatLoader)\n\n## 适用\n\n- Indicator 提供 Drive / Orbit / Static 三种点阵与12/15/18px尺寸。旧 Dots/Pulse 对应 Drive，Spinner 对应 Orbit。\n- label 或 aria-label / aria-labelledby 提供可访问状态名；已有可见状态文本时可省略，使点阵装饰性隐藏。\n- Skeleton 默认显示40px头像、两行与64px内容块。showAvatar / showBlock 控制默认组合，自定义 children 优先。\n- SkeletonBlock 仍为内容布局容器；新增 SkeletonPanel 是填充占位块。sm / lg 是保留的兼容尺寸，本批只对 md 做 Figma 几何核对。\n\n## 不适用\n\n- 点阵不是完成比例、执行回执或流式 A/B 定版。',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`ChatLoader`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/chat-message-actions`,title:`ChatMessageActions`,description:"Cube component `ChatMessageActions` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-message-actions`.",section:`cube`,markdown:'# ChatMessageActions\n\nCube component `ChatMessageActions` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-message-actions`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-message-actions`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { ChatMessageActions } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-message-actions";\nimport { ChatMessageActions } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n## Parts\n\n- `ChatMessageActions.CopiedIcon`\n- `ChatMessageActions.Copy`\n- `ChatMessageActions.CopyIcon`\n- `ChatMessageActions.Menu`\n- `ChatMessageActions.MenuIcon`\n- `ChatMessageActions.Regenerate`\n- `ChatMessageActions.RegenerateIcon`\n- `ChatMessageActions.ThumbsDown`\n- `ChatMessageActions.ThumbsDownIcon`\n- `ChatMessageActions.ThumbsUp`\n- `ChatMessageActions.ThumbsUpIcon`\n\n## Figma\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/D5ZApigd5hFmvI54TkJlAh/Cube-Design-System-for-Web?node-id=23491-1575\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#ChatMessageActions)',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`ChatMessageActions`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/chat-message`,title:`ChatMessage`,description:"Cube component `ChatMessage` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-message`.",section:`cube`,markdown:'# ChatMessage\n\nCube component `ChatMessage` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-message`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-message`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { ChatMessage } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-message";\nimport { ChatMessage } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n\n### Action\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `aria-label` | `string` | 否 | `—` | Defines a string value that labels the current element. |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | The children of the component. A function may be provided to alter the children based on component state. |\n| `fullWidth` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `isIconOnly` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `size` | `"md" \\| "lg" \\| "sm"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `tooltip` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `variant` | `"outline" \\| "ghost" \\| "danger" \\| "danger-soft" \\| "primary" \\| "secondary" \\| "tertiary"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `aria-controls` | `string` | 否 | `—` | Identifies the element (or elements) whose contents or presence are controlled by the current element. |\n| `aria-current` | `boolean \\| "true" \\| "false" \\| "time" \\| "page" \\| "date" \\| "step" \\| "location"` | 否 | `—` | Indicates whether this element represents the current item within a container or set of related elements. |\n| `aria-disabled` | `boolean \\| "true" \\| "false"` | 否 | `—` | Indicates whether the element is disabled to users of assistive technology. |\n| `aria-expanded` | `boolean \\| "true" \\| "false"` | 否 | `—` | Indicates whether the element, or another grouping element it controls, is currently expanded or collapsed. |\n| `aria-haspopup` | `boolean \\| "true" \\| "false" \\| "dialog" \\| "menu" \\| "grid" \\| "listbox" \\| "tree"` | 否 | `—` | Indicates the availability and type of interactive popup element, such as menu or dialog, that can be triggered by an element. |\n| `aria-pressed` | `boolean \\| "true" \\| "false" \\| "mixed"` | 否 | `—` | Indicates the current "pressed" state of toggle buttons. |\n| `autoFocus` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Whether the element should receive focus on render. |\n| `className` | `ClassNameOrFunction<ButtonRenderProps>` | 否 | `\'react-aria-Button\'` | The CSS [className](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/className) for the element. A function may be provided to compute the class based on component state. |\n| `form` | `string` | 否 | `—` | The `<form>` element to associate the button with. The value of this attribute must be the id of a `<form>` in the same document. See [MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/button#form). |\n| `formAction` | `string \\| ((formData: FormData) => void \\| Promise<void>)` | 否 | `—` | The URL that processes the information submitted by the button. Overrides the action attribute of the button\'s form owner. |\n| `formEncType` | `string` | 否 | `—` | Indicates how to encode the form data that is submitted. |\n| `formMethod` | `string` | 否 | `—` | Indicates the HTTP method used to submit the form. |\n| `formNoValidate` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Indicates that the form is not to be validated when it is submitted. |\n\n### Actions\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### Assistant\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### Avatar\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `alt` | `string` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `fallback` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `show` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `src` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### Body\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### Bubble\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### Content\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### Media\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n### User\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n## Parts\n\n- `ChatMessage.Action`\n- `ChatMessage.Actions`\n- `ChatMessage.Assistant`\n- `ChatMessage.Avatar`\n- `ChatMessage.Body`\n- `ChatMessage.Bubble`\n- `ChatMessage.Content`\n- `ChatMessage.Media`\n- `ChatMessage.User`\n\n## Figma\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/D5ZApigd5hFmvI54TkJlAh/Cube-Design-System-for-Web?node-id=23484-1149\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#ChatMessage)',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`ChatMessage`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/chat-source`,title:`ChatSource`,description:"Cube component `ChatSource` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-source`.",section:`cube`,markdown:'# ChatSource\n\nCube component `ChatSource` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-source`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-source`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { ChatSource } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-source";\nimport { ChatSource } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `description` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `enablePreview` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Controls the hover preview for URL sources. By default, preview is enabled when a URL source has a title or description. Set to `true` for custom preview content. |\n| `faviconUrl` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `href` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `sourceType` | `ChatSourceType` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `title` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n## Parts\n\n- `ChatSource.DocumentIcon`\n- `ChatSource.Icon`\n- `ChatSource.Preview`\n- `ChatSource.Title`\n- `ChatSource.Trigger`\n\n## Figma\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/D5ZApigd5hFmvI54TkJlAh/Cube-Design-System-for-Web?node-id=23493-1651\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#ChatSource)',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`ChatSource`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/chat-tool`,title:`ChatTool`,description:`由宿主传入六种工具状态。output-unknown 保留已有输出并提示核对回执。`,section:`cube`,markdown:'# ChatTool\n\nCube component `ChatTool` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-tool`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-tool`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { ChatTool } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/chat-tool";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `state` | `ToolPartState` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `active` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Show the activity indicator for an in-progress state. Defaults to the host state. |\n| `approveLabel` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `argsText` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | The children of the component. A function may be provided to alter the children based on component state. |\n| `errorText` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `input` | `unknown` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `isExpandable` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Whether the tool row can expand to reveal body content. Defaults to true for custom children. |\n| `output` | `unknown` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `rejectLabel` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `toolCallId` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `toolName` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `triggerPrefix` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | Preset: optional label before the tool name in the default trigger. |\n| `className` | `ClassNameOrFunction<DisclosureRenderProps>` | 否 | `\'react-aria-Disclosure\'` | The CSS [className](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/className) for the element. A function may be provided to compute the class based on component state. |\n| `defaultExpanded` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Whether the disclosure is expanded by default (uncontrolled). |\n| `id` | `Key` | 否 | `—` | An id for the disclosure when used within a DisclosureGroup, matching the id used in `expandedKeys`. |\n| `isDisabled` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Whether the disclosure is disabled. |\n| `isExpanded` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Whether the disclosure is expanded (controlled). |\n| `render` | `DOMRenderFunction<"div", DisclosureRenderProps>` | 否 | `—` | Overrides the default DOM element with a custom render function. This allows rendering existing components with built-in styles and behaviors such as router links, animation libraries, and pre-styled components. Requirements: - You must render the expected element type (e.g. if `<button>` is expected, you cannot render an `<a>`). - Only a single root DOM element can be rendered (no fragments). - You must pass through props and ref to the underlying DOM element, merging with your own prop as appropriate. |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | A slot name for the component. Slots allow the component to receive props from a parent component. An explicit `null` value indicates that the local props completely override all props received from a parent. |\n| `style` | `StyleOrFunction<DisclosureRenderProps>` | 否 | `—` | The inline [style](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/style) for the element. A function may be provided to compute the style based on component state. |\n\n<details className="not-prose my-6">\n<summary className="cursor-pointer text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground">无障碍与事件</summary>\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `onApprove` | `() => void` | 否 | `—` | Legacy intent callback. The host must authorize and execute the action separately. |\n| `onReject` | `() => void` | 否 | `—` | Legacy intent callback. Does not change the tool\'s state. |\n| `onExpandedChange` | `(isExpanded: boolean) => void` | 否 | `—` | Handler that is called when the disclosure\'s expanded state changes. |\n\n</details>\n\n## Parts\n\n- `ChatTool.Approval`\n- `ChatTool.ApprovalActions`\n- `ChatTool.Approve`\n- `ChatTool.Args`\n- `ChatTool.Content`\n- `ChatTool.Error`\n- `ChatTool.MCPArguments`\n- `ChatTool.MCPCode`\n- `ChatTool.MCPDetail`\n- `ChatTool.MCPResult`\n- `ChatTool.Meta`\n- `ChatTool.Reject`\n- `ChatTool.Result`\n- `ChatTool.Row`\n- `ChatTool.RowIcon`\n- `ChatTool.RowName`\n- `ChatTool.RowPath`\n- `ChatTool.RowResult`\n- `ChatTool.RowTime`\n- `ChatTool.StatusIcon`\n- `ChatTool.Trigger`\n\n## Token\n\n[`--border`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--border-tertiary`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--danger-soft-foreground`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--focus`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--font-mono`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--font-sans`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--foreground`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--muted`](#Docs/foundations/color)\n\n## Figma\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/D5ZApigd5hFmvI54TkJlAh/Cube-Design-System-for-Web?node-id=23492-1636\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#ChatTool)\n\n## 适用\n\n- 由宿主传入六种工具状态。output-unknown 保留已有输出并提示核对回执。\n- ChatToolGroup 默认直接组合 Calls；可选显式折叠头部保留手动展开状态。\n- MCPDetail 为现有详情 slot：server/tool/callId/receipt 由宿主提供，MCPArguments/MCPResult 组合显示内容。\n- MCPCode 只接收已经脱敏的展示文本，显示和复制共用同一 code；不提供隐藏原始 payload 或另一份复制值。\n\n## 不适用\n\n- requires-action 只是等待审批，不能当成授权；旧审批回调只发出意图。\n- 不要按动画结束推断成功，或自动折叠进行中、错误、未知及待审批调用。\n- not-executed 需要宿主明确确认未执行；connection-lost 表示可能已派发后断线，不可直接重试。连接、认证、授权、脱敏与重试由生产宿主处理。',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`ChatTool`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/code-block`,title:`CodeBlock`,description:`简单文本使用现有 Root/Header/Code/CopyButton；文件与逻辑行号组合 Numbered/Header/FileInfo/Lines。`,section:`cube`,markdown:'# CodeBlock\n\nCube component `CodeBlock` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/code-block`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/code-block`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { CodeBlock } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/code-block";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n## Parts\n\n- `CodeBlock.Code`\n- `CodeBlock.CopyButton`\n- `CodeBlock.FileInfo`\n- `CodeBlock.Header`\n- `CodeBlock.Line`\n- `CodeBlock.Lines`\n- `CodeBlock.Numbered`\n\n## Token\n\n[`--disabled-opacity`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--focus-inset`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--focus-outer`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--focus-outer-width`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--font-mono`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--foreground`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--muted`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--radius-lg`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--radius-sm`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--spacing`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--surface-secondary`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--surface-secondary-foreground`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-sm--line-height`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-ui`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-xs`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-xs--line-height`](#Docs/foundations/color)\n\n## Figma\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/D5ZApigd5hFmvI54TkJlAh/Cube-Design-System-for-Web?node-id=23479-1121\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#CodeBlock)\n\n## 适用\n\n- 简单文本使用现有 Root/Header/Code/CopyButton；文件与逻辑行号组合 Numbered/Header/FileInfo/Lines。\n- Lines 的 code 自动按逻辑换行生成行号；可通过 children 组合 Line。isStreaming 只反映宿主当前部分内容。\n- 复制只在 clipboard Promise 成功后反馈；内容变更后不把旧复制回执应用到新代码，等待期间阻止重复请求。\n\n## 不适用\n\n- 不要以复制图标、局部代码或动画判断工具执行成功。\n- 部分输出不由组件模拟定时追加，不引入未定流式 A/B。',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`CodeBlock`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/markdown`,title:`Markdown`,description:`children 接收宿主 Markdown 字符串；components 保留 ReactMarkdown 自定义渲染接口。`,section:`cube`,markdown:'# Markdown\n\nCube component `Markdown` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/markdown`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/markdown`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { Markdown } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/markdown";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `string` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `components` | `Partial<Components>` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `highlightCode` | `boolean` | 否 | `true` | Preserve syntax highlighting by default; false uses the canonical plain block. |\n| `id` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n## Token\n\n[`--foreground`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--muted`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-sm`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-base`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--font-sans`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--font-mono`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--surface-secondary`](#Docs/foundations/color)\n\n## Figma\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/D5ZApigd5hFmvI54TkJlAh/Cube-Design-System-for-Web?node-id=23490-1533\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#Markdown)\n\n## 适用\n\n- children 接收宿主 Markdown 字符串；components 保留 ReactMarkdown 自定义渲染接口。\n- highlightCode 默认 true 保留既有语法高亮；设置 false 显示 Figma canonical plain CodeBlock。\n- 静态正文14/24、块gap12、列表项gap8。示例用三级标题对应Figma可见标题；其他标题级别保留原层级。\n- 单行缩进代码按真实 Markdown AST 识别为代码块；跨行 inline code 仍为行内代码。\n\n## 不适用\n\n- 不要把显示文本、复制成功或流式动画当成 agent 执行回执或授权。\n- 本批不变更 StreamMarkdown 的动画、光标或默认参数，不选择流式 A/B。\n- 表格、引用、图片等未获完整Figma视觉核对；用户自定义 components 仍需自行维护布局、语义和文本处理。',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`Markdown`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/prompt-input`,title:`PromptInput`,description:`组合多行文本、附件、模型与项目入口，并通过 onSubmit / onStop 向宿主发出意图。`,section:`cube`,markdown:'# PromptInput\n\nCube component `PromptInput` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/prompt-input`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/prompt-input`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { PromptInput } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/prompt-input";\nimport { PromptInput } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `allowSubmitWhileRunning` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `isDisabled` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `isPending` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `isReadOnly` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Keep the draft readable while preventing editing and submission. |\n| `isUploading` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | Host-owned upload state; blocks submission without reporting upload success. |\n| `layout` | `PromptInputLayout` | 否 | `"stacked"` | Layout behavior for toolbar placement and inline resizing. |\n| `lockInputOnRun` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `maxHeight` | `string \\| number` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `size` | `"md" \\| "lg" \\| "sm"` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `status` | `ChatStatus` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `value` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `variant` | `PromptInputSurfaceVariant` | 否 | `"primary"` | Shell surface variant aligned with HeroUI OSS field inputs. |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n<details className="not-prose my-6">\n<summary className="cursor-pointer text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground">无障碍与事件</summary>\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `onStop` | `() => void` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `onSubmit` | `() => void` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `onValueChange` | `(value: string) => void` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n</details>\n\n## Parts\n\n- `PromptInput.Action`\n- `PromptInput.Attachments`\n- `PromptInput.CardStack`\n- `PromptInput.Content`\n- `PromptInput.ContextTray`\n- `PromptInput.Footer`\n- `PromptInput.Queue`\n- `PromptInput.QuickActions`\n- `PromptInput.Send`\n- `PromptInput.Shell`\n- `PromptInput.TextArea`\n- `PromptInput.Token`\n- `PromptInput.TokenInput`\n- `PromptInput.TokenSuggestions`\n- `PromptInput.Tokens`\n- `PromptInput.Toolbar`\n- `PromptInput.ToolbarEnd`\n- `PromptInput.ToolbarStart`\n\n## Token\n\n[`--accent`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--accent-disabled`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--accent-foreground`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--accent-soft`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--border-secondary`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--default`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--default-hover`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--default-soft`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--disabled-opacity`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--field-background`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--field-foreground`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--field-placeholder`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--focus-outer`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--font-sans`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--font-weight-normal`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--foreground`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--muted`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--overlay`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--radius`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--radius-2xl`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--radius-3xl`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--radius-md`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--radius-sm`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--radius-xl`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--spacing`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--surface-secondary`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--surface-shadow`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-sm`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-sm--line-height`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-ui`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-ui--line-height`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-xs`](#Docs/foundations/color)\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#PromptInput)\n\n## 适用\n\n- 组合多行文本、附件、模型与项目入口，并通过 onSubmit / onStop 向宿主发出意图。\n- Primary / Secondary 支持 stacked、inline、compact 与 sm / md / lg；小屏点击区域使用新增 mobile 布局（本批核对 Primary / sm）。\n- 上传状态由 isUploading 传入；只读用 isReadOnly。宿主维护文件、模型、队列和运行状态。\n\n## 不适用\n\n- 不要把示例点击或状态标签当成授权、上传完成或真实 agent 执行。\n- 未选择的流式 A/B 方案不由此组件定版。\n- TokenInput 依赖 React Aria alpha API；本批兼容检查不代表读屏或跨浏览器验收。',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`PromptInput`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/prompt-suggestion`,title:`PromptSuggestion`,description:`pill 用于简短建议；card 用 ItemTitle / ItemDescription 展示较长建议，onPress 仅向宿主发出选择意图。`,section:`cube`,markdown:'# PromptSuggestion\n\nCube component `PromptSuggestion` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/prompt-suggestion`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/prompt-suggestion`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { PromptSuggestion } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/prompt-suggestion";\nimport { PromptSuggestion } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `variant` | `"pill" \\| "card"` | 否 | `"pill"` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n## Parts\n\n- `PromptSuggestion.Description`\n- `PromptSuggestion.Group`\n- `PromptSuggestion.Header`\n- `PromptSuggestion.Item`\n- `PromptSuggestion.ItemDescription`\n- `PromptSuggestion.ItemFooter`\n- `PromptSuggestion.ItemMeta`\n- `PromptSuggestion.ItemTags`\n- `PromptSuggestion.ItemTitle`\n- `PromptSuggestion.Items`\n- `PromptSuggestion.Title`\n\n## Token\n\n[`--foreground`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--muted`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--border`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--focus-outer`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--disabled-foreground`](#Docs/foundations/color) [`--text-sm`](#Docs/foundations/color)\n\n## Figma\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/D5ZApigd5hFmvI54TkJlAh/Cube-Design-System-for-Web?node-id=23486-1140\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#PromptSuggestion)\n\n## 适用\n\n- pill 用于简短建议；card 用 ItemTitle / ItemDescription 展示较长建议，onPress 仅向宿主发出选择意图。\n- card 与 pill 都支持 React Aria isDisabled / isPending。卡片内不放链接、按钮等嵌套交互控件。\n- ItemTitle / ItemDescription / ItemFooter / ItemTags 为 span slots；如之前依赖 HeroUI Card 的 render prop 或 h3/p/div refs，需要迁移至对应 span 原生属性。\n\n## 不适用\n\n- 选择建议不代表提交、授权或启动 agent。\n- 只核对 card default 视觉稿；焦点和禁用是代码侧无障碍补充，未声称 Figma 已新增同名状态。',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`PromptSuggestion`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/rich-text-editor`,title:`RichTextEditor`,description:"Cube component `RichTextEditor` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/rich-text-editor`.",section:`cube`,markdown:'# RichTextEditor\n\nCube component `RichTextEditor` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/rich-text-editor`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/rich-text-editor`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { RichTextEditor } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/rich-text-editor";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `defaultValue` | `JSONContent` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `editorOptions` | `Partial<EditorOptions>` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `extensions` | `Extensions` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `isDisabled` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `isReadOnly` | `boolean` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `maxLength` | `number` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `placeholder` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `value` | `JSONContent` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `variant` | `RichTextEditorSurfaceVariant` | 否 | `"primary"` | Shell surface variant aligned with HeroUI OSS field inputs. |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n<details className="not-prose my-6">\n<summary className="cursor-pointer text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground">无障碍与事件</summary>\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `onValueChange` | `(value: JSONContent, details: RichTextEditorValueChangeDetails) => void` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n</details>\n\n## Parts\n\n- `RichTextEditor.ActionButton`\n- `RichTextEditor.BubbleMenu`\n- `RichTextEditor.CharacterCount`\n- `RichTextEditor.CommandButton`\n- `RichTextEditor.Content`\n- `RichTextEditor.FloatingMenu`\n- `RichTextEditor.Footer`\n- `RichTextEditor.LinkPopover`\n- `RichTextEditor.Shell`\n- `RichTextEditor.SuggestionMenu`\n- `RichTextEditor.ToggleButton`\n- `RichTextEditor.Toolbar`\n- `RichTextEditor.ToolbarGroup`\n- `RichTextEditor.ToolbarSeparator`\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#RichTextEditor)',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`RichTextEditor`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/scheduled-task`,title:`ScheduledTask`,description:"Cube component `ScheduledTask` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/scheduled-task`.",section:`cube`,markdown:'# ScheduledTask\n\nCube component `ScheduledTask` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/scheduled-task`.\n\n- 分层：Cube\n- 包：`@bosagent/cube-ui/scheduled-task`\n- 状态：建设中\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport { ScheduledTask } from "@bosagent/cube-ui/scheduled-task";\nimport { ScheduledTask } from "@bosagent/cube-ui";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n## 属性\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `children` | `ReactNode` | 是 | `—` | — |\n| `className` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n| `slot` | `string` | 否 | `—` | — |\n\n## Parts\n\n- `ScheduledTask.Actions`\n- `ScheduledTask.Footer`\n- `ScheduledTask.Header`\n- `ScheduledTask.Main`\n- `ScheduledTask.Meta`\n- `ScheduledTask.Next`\n- `ScheduledTask.Record`\n- `ScheduledTask.Result`\n- `ScheduledTask.Title`\n\n## 画廊\n\n[Open in gallery](#ScheduledTask)',preview:{kind:`cube`,name:`ScheduledTask`},boards:[]},{slug:`cube/agent-status`,title:`AgentStatus`,description:"Cube component `AgentStatus` from `@bosagent/cube-ui/agent-status`.",section:`cube`,markdown:`# AgentStatus

